{{#> layout title="Your InterviewCall readiness assessment" preheader=preheader}}
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Hi {{firstName}},</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Following your conversation with our team today, your next step is the InterviewCall readiness assessment. It takes approximately {{durationMinutes}} minutes.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The objective isn't simply to label you as "good" or "bad." We use the assessment to understand how your current preparation compares with the kind of engineering and interview expectations you're targeting. That gives us a much better basis for your next discussion than making assumptions from your resume alone.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;"><strong>Your assessment</strong><br>
Scheduled: {{scheduledAt}}<br>
<a href="{{testPortalUrl}}" style="color:#1d2f6f;font-weight:600;">Start your assessment →</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 8px;">A few recommendations:</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:22px;">
  <li style="margin:0 0 4px;">Take it in one sitting</li>
  <li style="margin:0 0 4px;">Avoid external distractions</li>
  <li style="margin:0 0 4px;">Answer based on your current understanding</li>
  <li style="margin:0;">Don't worry about trying to manufacture a perfect score</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The result is useful precisely because it gives us a realistic picture of where you stand today. Once it's completed, our team will take you through the next step.</p>
<p style="margin:0;">Regards,<br>{{appName}}</p>
{{/layout}}
